; realm icons (docs/ART.md 11.5): religions (icon16/religion_<x>, icon8/religion_<x>, found by name;
; the faith's colour dominates), alignments (alignment_good|neutral|evil), civic categories
; (civic_<CIVICOPTION without prefix>) and the 18 mana spheres (icon8/sphere_<x>: the rune in the
; sphere's colour; the promotion seals reuse them).

